{"id": "EUVD-2026-71276", "enisaUuid": "204b2fd0-2acc-30da-a8ae-f238b18044ca", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nUSB: c67x00: fix use-after-free in c67x00_add_iso_urb()\n\nWhen TD creation fails for the last packet of an isochronous URB,\nc67x00_add_iso_urb() gives the URB back before updating the endpoint\nscheduling state.\n\nc67x00_giveback_urb() frees the URB private data, and the completion\ncallback may release the final URB reference. The following accesses to\nurbp->ep_data, urb->interval, and urbp->cnt can therefore use freed\nmemory.\n\nUpdate next_frame and cnt before giving back the failed final packet,\nmaking the giveback the last operation that uses the URB and its private\ndata.", "datePublished": "2026-09-04T15:54:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:44:18", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e4039e9bebb528dd9cd7ac72aeaec529c26c355a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ade18b4ce78a16558f4f435aece80082f6f7b64c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bb572801290e25ec1c4753d14af35777303f5d6b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/62cd519ab74cac499036cd88c11692f8f0d53e14", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ff172092cba7ec990ecc7b610ce703e19570b8f0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b4cb8081cf80f82e48fbe9c021a8f6d0fa2ed421", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7983daa159981fac125db2457437723f38ea1472", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f24dcc61bd0ecf7639fac5bf700450b398d793a7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b1e24de475bf2d66fffc9103f3444b783527d55a"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-80826", "GHSA-24fg-x37m-25c7"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0b6b0735-f66f-316b-9860-85b74eadea2d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "e9b29ffc519b9e63d4e1c0b1278bb951bb418a9d <f24dcc61bd0ecf7639fac5bf700450b398d793a7"}, {"id": "1b8d90f5-ec07-3dd9-a232-4240889d727b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "